{"title":"Gizmo's Observatory","slug":"Gizmo's_Observatory","hero":{"file":"Observatory.webp","width":400,"height":488},"pageid":3623,"revid":18150,"timestamp":"2025-06-06T14:46:56Z","lastEditor":"Xonerix","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island (Snowlands)"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Gizmo"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Purchasing mid-game to late-game items."},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.71.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>Gizmo's Observatory is a shop located in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowlands/\">Snowlands</a>. It is primarily accessible through taking a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_&_B/\">cable car</a> available up the hill when entering the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowlands/\">Snowlands</a>. It is owned by <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gizmo/\">Gizmo</a>.  \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"notes\">Notes:</h3>\n<ul><li>It is required to pull both book levers on the first floor of the observatory in order to open up the trapdoor located in the back to purchase the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Metal_Detector/\">Metal Detector</a>.\n<ul><li>The first book lever is located under the fallen book cabinet and the second is on the top shelf of the standing books cabinet next to the <span title=\"Winter Breeze Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2ludGVyX0JyZWV6ZV9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Winter Breeze</span> vinyl.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If you want to get to the 2nd floor you will need a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lab_Card/\">Lab Card</a>. From there, you want to put it on the key card swiper so you can get to the second floor to buy the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Keycard/\">Red Keycard</a> and <span title=\"Cozy Cabin Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ296eV9DYWJpbl9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cozy Cabin Vinyl</span>.</li>\n<li>There are two music vinyls in the Observatory. <span title=\"Winter Breeze Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2ludGVyX0JyZWV6ZV9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Winter Breeze</span> is on the first floor and the <span title=\"Cozy Cabin Vinyl (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ296eV9DYWJpbl9WaW55bD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cozy Cabin</span> on the second.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Telescope/\">Meteor Telescope</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Meteor Telescope\">Meteor Telescope</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$150,160\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Weather_Radar/\">Weather Radar</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Weather Radar\">Weather Radar</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$90,670\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sled/\">Sled</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sledred\">Sledred</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$1,400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Keycard/\">Observatory Keycard</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Observatory Card\">Observatory Card</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$50,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Metal_Detector/\">Metal Detector</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Metal\">Metal</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$32,500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flamethrower/\">Flamethrower</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BoxedFlameThrower\">BoxedFlameThrower</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$323,420\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Other info: there are two music disks in the observatory. One on the first and One on the second floor. The disks are \"cozy cabin\" and \"winter breeze\".\n</p>"}
